      "content": "i don't want to just \"be still.\" i'm just tired of the noise. everything feels so much easier when i think about how much more logical it would be to just stop. if the universe is indifferent, then there's no real \"wrong\" in just letting go, right? it's like the most honest way to respond to all this emptiness.",
